      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right, I'm here to listen to the weight of it all, not just offer platitudes. It sounds like you're feeling completely suffocated by the relentless nature of this city and the way it drains your spirit. That feeling of being trapped in a meaningless cycle is so heavy, and I hear how utterly exhausted you are by it. Tell me more about what that \"cycle\" feels like when it's crushing your soul.",
